<task id="051" project="spaarkeai-compose-r4">
  <metadata>
    <title>eTag sequencing for create-on-save (no eTag-mismatch 500) (FR-08)</title>
    <phase>5 Concurrency + save</phase>
    <gate>blocked</gate>
    <status>not-started</status>
    <rigor>FULL</rigor>
    <rigor-reason>BFF implementation on the ComposeService save/create path modifying .cs; root-cause fix of a deployed eTag 500; irreversible ordered save sequence; tags include bff-api + spe.</rigor-reason>
    <model-tier>sonnet</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>Root-cause of the deployed eTag 500 is well-understood (stale precondition after the create-on-save follow-up write advances the item eTag); the fix is a defined, ordered sequencing change on an existing path.</model-tier-reason>
    <effort>xhigh</effort>
